</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>2001 Volvo award winner in clinical studies: Effects of a media campaign on back pain beliefs and its potential influence on management of low back pain in general practice</article-title><source>Spine</source><year>2001</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>2535</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11725233</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00007632-200112010-00005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>FORIS: Database for research projects in social science</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.gesis.org/Information/FORIS/Recherche/index.htm"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>